=== HINT 1 ===
IMAGE_FIRST_SECTION(nt) returns a PIMAGE_SECTION_HEADER to the first section.
It's defined in <winnt.h>.

=== HINT 2 ===
Iteration:
  PIMAGE_SECTION_HEADER sec = IMAGE_FIRST_SECTION(nt);
  for (WORD i = 0; i < num_sections; i++, sec++) { ... }

Section name: sec->Name is BYTE[8], NOT null-terminated if exactly 8 chars.
Use %.8s format or copy to a 9-byte buffer and null-terminate.

Characteristics flags of interest:
  IMAGE_SCN_MEM_EXECUTE  0x20000000
  IMAGE_SCN_MEM_READ     0x40000000
  IMAGE_SCN_MEM_WRITE    0x80000000

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
PIMAGE_SECTION_HEADER sec = IMAGE_FIRST_SECTION(nt);
printf("%-8s  VA=0x%08X  RawSize=0x%08X  Chars=0x%08X\n",
       "Name", "VirtAddr", "RawSize", "Chars");
for (WORD i = 0; i < num_sections; i++, sec++) {
    printf("%-8.8s  0x%08X    0x%08X     0x%08X\n",
           sec->Name,
           sec->VirtualAddress,
           sec->SizeOfRawData,
           sec->Characteristics);
}
